Modifications made in this repository:

  * Deepgram's Voice Agent API as a voice provider.
    daemon/src/agentring/voice/deepgram.py adds a RealtimeBackend for
    wss://agent.deepgram.com/v1/agent/converse, and
    daemon/src/agentring/voice/providers.py registers it as `--provider deepgram`
    (DEEPGRAM_API_KEY). It is a standalone backend, not an OpenAI-Realtime
    subclass: Deepgram's protocol is its own (raw binary audio frames,
    `Authorization: Token`, its own event names), though the tool schemas are
    OpenAI Chat-Completions shaped and port over unchanged.

  * A fix in the voice bench. daemon/src/agentring/voice/bench.py used to drop
    every event that arrived while the spoken prompt was still playing, which
    lost the tool calls of providers that dispatch a function call before the
    user's turn is confirmed (Deepgram does; its docs recommend
    `defer_until_eot` for exactly this). Those events are now buffered and
    replayed once the prompt has finished.

  * A deployment for boxd VMs. deploy/Caddyfile.boxd,
    deploy/docker-compose.boxd.yml, deploy/livekit.boxd.yaml, deploy/setup.sh,
    deploy/pair.sh and deploy/.env.boxd.example run the relay, LiveKit and the
    daemon on a boxd VM, where the public HTTPS proxy and a single forwarded
    TCP port stand in for a VPS with open UDP. See docs/boxd.md.
